  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Rafforzamento degli ospedali di Shire e Gondar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening of Shire and Gondar hospitals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Il progetto mira a migliorare l&#x2019;accesso a servizi sanitari di qualita&#x2019; ed inclusivi in due aree fortemente colpite dai recenti conflitti, attraverso la riabilitazione e la costruzione infrastrutturale e la fornitura di attrezzature mediche.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving the access to quality and inclusive health services in two areas highly affected by recent conflicts, through infrastructural rehabilitation and construction and the provision of medical equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
